OL,3,GNEWSATeens urge government not to scrap
OL,4,AYouth Parliament
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree young politicians from across the
OL,7,Fnorth-west of England have called on
OL,8,Fthe government to rethink plans to axe
OL,9,Fthe UK Youth Parliament (UKYP).
OL,11,FThe parliament - which has more than
OL,12,F300 elected members aged between 11 and
OL,13,F18 - was established in 1999 to boost
OL,14,Finterest in politics among young
OL,15,Fpeople.
OL,17,FThe Department for Culture, Media and
OL,18,FSport (DCMS) is not committed to
OL,19,Ffunding the parliament beyond March
OL,20,F2027, leading to speculation it could
OL,21,Fclose.
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,404,400,260,160,0,100
